MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cb47386fd142f2a4eb622d19fb89f062, type: 3}
  m_Name: MartinConversation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  graphId: martin.awning.conversation
  startNodeId: start
  nodes:
  - id: start
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: The awning leaks in three places. I have named them. The names are not
      helping.
    nextNodeId: 
    mood: ANXIETY
    choices:
    - label: Ask what he is guarding.
      responseNodeId: guarding
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: asked_guard
      skillTag: logic
      unavailableHint: 
    - label: Tell him the rain has a point.
      responseNodeId: rain
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: 
      skillTag: empathy
      unavailableHint: 
    - label: Say nothing. Let the silence do paperwork.
      responseNodeId: silence
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: 
      skillTag: inland_empire
      unavailableHint: 
  - id: guarding
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: 'A door. Behind it: a room. Inside the room: an idea that has not paid
      rent.'
    nextNodeId: 
    mood: LOGIC
    choices:
    - label: Offer to inspect the door.
      responseNodeId: inspect
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: 
      skillTag: authority
      unavailableHint: 
    - label: Back away from the idea.
      responseNodeId: end
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: 
      skillTag: volition
      unavailableHint: 
  - id: rain
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: That is a dangerous way to look at weather. But... yes. It does seem deliberate
      tonight.
    nextNodeId: 
    mood: EMPATHY
    choices:
    - label: Ask about the chalk marks nearby.
      responseNodeId: chalk
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: 
      skillTag: perception
      unavailableHint: 
    - label: Leave him with the rain.
      responseNodeId: end
      requiredFlag: 
      requiredFact: 
      setFlag: 
      skillTag: volition
      unavailableHint: 
  - id: silence
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: 'Good. You understand the first rule of this district: everything speaks
      when you stop helping it.'
    nextNodeId: end
    mood: INLAND EMPIRE
    choices: []
  - id: inspect
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: No. Actually, don't. The door is doing fine without witnesses.
    nextNodeId: end
    mood: AUTHORITY
    choices: []
  - id: chalk
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: Those are not marks. They are a map of where the city forgets to look.
    nextNodeId: end
    mood: PERCEPTION
    choices: []
  - id: end
    speaker: MARTIN
    portraitGlyph: M
    text: The awning drips. The district waits. You can come back when you have a
      better question.
    nextNodeId: 
    mood: NEUTRAL
    choices: []
